sol:'Compute $dh/dt$ using Euler-Lagrange: every term cancels except $-\\partial L/\\partial t$, so $\\partial L/\\partial t = 0$ makes $h$ a constant of motion. For natural systems ($V$ velocity-independent, constraints fixed) this $h$ equals $T + V$ — the total energy.',
