sol:'$\\theta$ is cyclic, so $p_\\theta = \\partial L/\\partial\\dot{\\theta} = mr^{2}\\dot{\\theta} = $ const $= L_z$. Conservation of angular momentum is automatic for central forces — the potential cannot exert a torque.',
